canoscan-lide400-driver (1.2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release. Driver enablement package for the Canon CanoScan
    LiDE 400 USB flatbed scanner (USB 04a9:1912).
  * udev rule tags the device for SANE (libsane_matched), grants the
    scanner group access and keeps USB autosuspend off.
  * postinst reloads udev and checks that the installed SANE advertises
    LiDE 400 support.
  * Ships README and provenance documentation derived from static
    analysis of the Windows driver installer (CD-1803-000320 v1.2).

 -- mickykhd <mickykhd@users.noreply.github.com>  Mon, 26 Oct 2026 18:50:00 +0000